{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Folklore to Gameplay: Meet the Real Vampires</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Vampires</strong> is a narrative-driven adventure game that blends dark humor, eerie poetry, and authentic Slavic vampire folklore into a unique interactive experience. Developed by <strong>Those Eyes</strong>, the Copenhagen-based studio behind the award-winning <i>Cosmic Top Secret</i>, this game invites players to explore real stories of fear, death, and transformation\u2014told through the eyes of both vampire and folk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/70f30316ba0ca779506a4ee48d833d8b.poster.avif?t=1770288841\" width=256 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/70f30316ba0ca779506a4ee48d833d8b.webm?t=1770288841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Dr. \u0141ukasz Kozak\u2019s haunting anthology <i>With Stake and Spade: Vampiric Diversity in Poland</i>, the game breathes (undead) life into real historical accounts of vampirism. Kozak is the protagonist, leading you through chilling tales rooted in local beliefs, from plague burials to devoured shrouds, and be forced to ask: who are the real monsters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/5303b277a57cfd39a1ef527b495fa8f7.poster.avif?t=1770288841\" width=256 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/5303b277a57cfd39a1ef527b495fa8f7.webm?t=1770288841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn\u2019t just a walk through the graveyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level features <strong>inverse mechanics</strong> that flip traditional gameplay on its head. Progress through failure, question your actions, and see the world from both sides of the stake. Because in Real Vampires, <strong>failure is not the end, but the beginning of a greater understanding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll dig, slice, chew, bake, and bleed through surreal mini-games that challenge your assumptions\u2014sometimes literally. Humor and horror go hand-in-hand as you unearth buried truths and encounter undead beings that are frightening, absurd, and oddly relatable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/8f97a642c67a9bd4ffd028b3fed7db89.poster.avif?t=1770288841\" width=256 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/8f97a642c67a9bd4ffd028b3fed7db89.webm?t=1770288841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/328098e3b65e740c3cba9b21886f5849.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dual Perspectives on the stories as both vampire and folk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/d3df7afca3658117bd6501abf171b6c0.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Replay levels with original <i>inverse mechanics</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/88bd9acf0b4f0eb42a3f6356c1a69b67.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Artwork and animation inspired by Slavic art and Monty Python-style absurdism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/8a664368fad146e9b9c1d6e2dd860b54.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Inspired by real accounts of Slavic folklore, respectfully adapted in collaboration with cultural experts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/6ad4bacfbf1558743812d9e1e84aa219.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A narrative tone that balances dark humor with historical depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/3a64531475218c0026772977a26d1994.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A cross-border collaboration with creatives and folklore scholars from Poland and Denmark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is supported by: The Danish Film Institute, The Danish Arts Foundation, Creative Europe &amp; Adam Mickiewicz Institute.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Uncover the Real Vampires\u2014if you dare.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Re-Burial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812240/4e6681be264f4b29b2bc9b12078d693648c3165f.jpg"},{"name":"A Woman Twice Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812240/0a8e1c33adbdef617a587a2f169fa39b04dda5bd.jpg"},{"name":"Family Jewels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812240/05eb4fc1639b6486eec39a2d4cd9d858a80548f8.jpg"},{"name":"Blood Transfusion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812240/9003a4ad7046fbf18f2f970423ed7f49b901d95e.jpg"},{"name":"Old Beliefs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812240/9648ddd58645a4d2575031104d7061facd2b644a.jpg"},{"name":"Don\u2019t Diagnose the Past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812240/510051c6dd1e997e3a95bff661dd2daa081ea224.jpg"},{"name":"No Rationalisation!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812240/9a0c33a04027d0defa103a06bcd7700d47da65f1.jpg"},{"name":"How Queer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812240/6efb5968c55b00212b5d6268410b201130f5d621.jpg"},{"name":"Oh, Deer!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812240/49c4fa23a0e122c0135cba454611bf1088441fc1.jpg"},{"name":"O Canada!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812240/e818b2d6477664399ff2688492249e0051c13c00.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812240?t=1770288841","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/e6d4eecc5af0f16d41023f7359b76cae4b895042/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770288841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/f751fefc530a57c5bf90a3ee5dfcdf624745ec9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770288841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/f751fefc530a57c5bf90a3ee5dfcdf624745ec9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770288841","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Real Vampires contains stylized and humorous depictions of mature and folkloric themes, presented in a theatrical collage style reminiscent of Monty Python animation. Early in the game, a topless female character appears in a symbolic scene involving decapitation \u2014 depending on point of view, the player may either attempt to decapitate her or help her avoid being decapitated. Other scenes include the removal of fingers, fingernails, and genitals from deceased vampires, presented in a non-realistic medical illustration style.\r\n\r\nThe game also features surreal humor around themes of desire and death, including a scene where a vampire offers flowers to his half-naked wife, implying intimacy and resulting in the birth of vampire babies. While the game explores dark topics, it does so through satire and symbolism, not realism or shock."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Folklore to Gameplay: Meet the Real Vampires</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Vampires</strong> is a narrative-driven adventure game that blends dark humor, eerie poetry, and authentic Slavic vampire folklore into a unique interactive experience. Developed by <strong>Those Eyes</strong>, the Copenhagen-based studio behind the award-winning <i>Cosmic Top Secret</i>, this game invites players to explore real stories of fear, death, and transformation\u2014told through the eyes of both vampire and folk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/70f30316ba0ca779506a4ee48d833d8b.poster.avif?t=1770288841\" width=256 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/70f30316ba0ca779506a4ee48d833d8b.webm?t=1770288841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Dr. \u0141ukasz Kozak\u2019s haunting anthology <i>With Stake and Spade: Vampiric Diversity in Poland</i>, the game breathes (undead) life into real historical accounts of vampirism. Kozak is the protagonist, leading you through chilling tales rooted in local beliefs, from plague burials to devoured shrouds, and be forced to ask: who are the real monsters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/5303b277a57cfd39a1ef527b495fa8f7.poster.avif?t=1770288841\" width=256 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/5303b277a57cfd39a1ef527b495fa8f7.webm?t=1770288841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn\u2019t just a walk through the graveyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level features <strong>inverse mechanics</strong> that flip traditional gameplay on its head. Progress through failure, question your actions, and see the world from both sides of the stake. Because in Real Vampires, <strong>failure is not the end, but the beginning of a greater understanding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll dig, slice, chew, bake, and bleed through surreal mini-games that challenge your assumptions\u2014sometimes literally. Humor and horror go hand-in-hand as you unearth buried truths and encounter undead beings that are frightening, absurd, and oddly relatable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/8f97a642c67a9bd4ffd028b3fed7db89.poster.avif?t=1770288841\" width=256 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/8f97a642c67a9bd4ffd028b3fed7db89.webm?t=1770288841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/328098e3b65e740c3cba9b21886f5849.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dual Perspectives on the stories as both vampire and folk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/d3df7afca3658117bd6501abf171b6c0.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Replay levels with original <i>inverse mechanics</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/88bd9acf0b4f0eb42a3f6356c1a69b67.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Artwork and animation inspired by Slavic art and Monty Python-style absurdism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/8a664368fad146e9b9c1d6e2dd860b54.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Inspired by real accounts of Slavic folklore, respectfully adapted in collaboration with cultural experts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/6ad4bacfbf1558743812d9e1e84aa219.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A narrative tone that balances dark humor with historical depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/extras/3a64531475218c0026772977a26d1994.webp?t=1770288841\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A cross-border collaboration with creatives and folklore scholars from Poland and Denmark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is supported by: The Danish Film Institute, The Danish Arts Foundation, Creative Europe &amp; Adam Mickiewicz Institute.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Uncover the Real Vampires\u2014if you dare.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Those Eyes"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812240/8907abb8d078d1dff4c67fcabf6a82f3f78f06dd/header.jpg?t=1770288841","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.14 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core\u2122 i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.14 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core\u2122 i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3812240/1675836057/1973efc84d4902b4b5d3fa51e067f551d444feb7/1764071717/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764072191","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3812240/1675836057/1973efc84d4902b4b5d3fa51e067f551d444feb7/1764071717/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764072191","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3812240/1675836057/1973efc84d4902b4b5d3fa51e067f551d444feb7/1764071